The first evaluator invocation failed before a candidate result because it imported a wrapper module lacking lagged_cost_inputs. After correcting the import, all 162 calculations in a second invocation completed in memory, but summary assembly failed on a plan-key name mismatch before writing the report and ledgers. Both code mismatches were fixed, the frozen batch rerun from archived inputs, and only the successful final run was registered. No strategy spec or OOS boundary changed.
